    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "3. The endings"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Take off -ar, -er or -ir and add the ending. In the preterite <b>-er and -ir verbs share exactly the same endings</b>. Compare this with the present tense, where they differ."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "style": "endings",
      "widths": [
        5.0,
        4.0,
        4.0,
        4.0
      ],
      "head": [
