      "type": "p",
      "text": "Stem-changing <b>-ir</b> verbs (the ones with e/ie, e/i or o/ue in the present) also change in the preterite, but <b>only in the él/ella/usted and ellos/ellas/ustedes forms</b>: o becomes u and e becomes i."
