        [
          "Ayer hablo con Ana.",
          "Ayer hablé con Ana.",
          "A finished action in the past needs the preterite, not the present."
        ],
        [
          "Ayer he trabajado mucho.",
          "Ayer trabajé mucho.",
          "With ayer, anoche and other finished periods use the preterite. The present perfect is for today (PDF 5)."
